# {{lb|en|medicine}} An anesthetic (anesthetic substance) that causes loss of sensation only to the area to which it is applied.
#* {{RQ:Hemingway Farewell to Arms|chapter=15
|passage=He used a '''local anaesthetic''' called something or other "snow," which froze the tissue and avoided pain until the probe, the scalpel or the forceps got below the frozen portion.}}

